local
.DS_Store
/.direnv
# Claude Code local overrides and worktrees (see .envrc). Shared agent config
# under .claude/ is trackable; these two are per-machine and are not.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
.claire
/target
# Raw coverage profiles. `bin/coverage` keeps its own under the target dir, but
# `cargo llvm-cov` exports `RUSTFLAGS=-C instrument-coverage`, and `quilt run`'s
# tests hand that to `rust-script` — so the *generated* programs are built
# instrumented too and drop `default_*.profraw` in whatever directory they ran
# in. Not anchored: they land next to whichever crate the test ran from.
*.profraw
*.profdata
